cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Semiconductor Process Control: statistical process control and root-cause screening on the UCI SECOM fab dataset"
abstract: >-
  Production test monitoring and process control analysis of 1,567 runs of
  the UCI SECOM semiconductor fab dataset: sensor audit, causal imputation,
  Laney p'-charts, a simulation-calibrated Bernoulli CUSUM, FDR-controlled
  sensor screens, forward-chronological failure models, PCA multivariate SPC,
  change-point analysis, a replay monitor and a Power BI star schema export,
  validated against the Tennessee Eastman process benchmark.
